riminating among chromosomal forms of <italic>Anopheles gambiae </italic>s.s</article-title><source>Insect Mol Biol</source><year>2001</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>19</fpage><lpage>23</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11240633</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1365-2583.2001.00236.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gentile</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Slotman</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ketmaier</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Powell</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Caccone</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Attempts to molecularly distinguish cryptic taxa in <italic>Anopheles gambiae </italic>s.s</article-title><source>Insect Mol Biol</source><year>2001</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>25</fpage><lpage>32</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11240634</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1365-2583.2001.00237.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wilkins</surname><given-names>EE</given-names></name><name><surname>Howell</surname><given-names>PI</given-names></name><name><surname>Benedict</surname><given-names>MQ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>X and Y chromosome inheritance and mixtures of rDNA intergenic spacer regions in <italic>Anopheles gambiae</italic></article-title><source>Insect Mol Biol</source><year>2007</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>735</fpage><lpage>741</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18093002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lanzaro</surname><given-names>GC</given-names></name><name><surname>Tour&#x000e9;</surname><given-names>YT</given-names></name><name><surname>Carnahan</surname><giv